        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>Koloss are deadly foes at any tier of play. Even a <strong>koloss neophyte</strong> can Demoralize their enemies, strike with their Koloss Blade to knock their chosen victim Prone, then Pulverize to deal heavy damage to the Prone target. A more experienced <strong>koloss veteran</strong> uses their Decimate action when surrounded, and they rely on their Consuming Rage to ensure their Koloss Blade and Pulverize actions strike true. A <strong>koloss ancient</strong> has even further command of the battlefield. With their Frenzied Charge reaction, they can close the gap to a new set of foes with devastating momentum.</p><p></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-worldguide.worldguide.JournalEntry.dyFd1f6iBIXYU1K7.JournalEntryPage.QfAandoOAdnQSn60]{Koloss Encounter Opportunities and Complications}</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-worldguide.worldguide.JournalEntry.dyFd1f6iBIXYU1K7.JournalEntryPage.QfAandoOAdnQSn60 inline]</p>",
        "role": "rival"
